 thm of Brazil with Forró No Marketta\, a free monthly night of music\, da
 ncing and good vibes. Kick things off with a free forró lesson at 6pm\, t
 hen enjoy social dancing and a DJ set from 7pm. Forró is a lively and pla
 yful partner dance from the North of Brazil\, perfect for beginners and se
 asoned dancers alike. With street food\, great company and our signature B
 razilian caipirinhas flowing\, it’s the ultimate midweek escape. Join us
  every third Thursday of the month and experience something a little diffe
