SUMMARY:Laura king (Melb)
DESCRIPTION:laura King is a leading force in Australia’s contemporary tec
 hno/trance scene\, and for the last decade she’s been bridging the gap b
 etween global trends and local flavour - all a reflection of her passion a
 nd vast experiences within our dance music world. She loves to craft sets 
 that reflect the full spectrum of her musical journey\, driven by intuitio
 n and refined by years of experience. Laura's sound is both deeply persona
 l\, yet always future focused. Rooted in the underground and shaped by bot
 h global dance floors and the wide-open energy of the Australian bush. Her
  style is anchored by techno and trance with merging elements of contempor
 ary hard dance\, groove\, psychedelic sub genres\, tribe\, tekno and all t
 hings fast\, quirky and bottom heavy. A true selector at heart <3 Laura's 
 really honing in on her productions at the moment\, and after a decade of 
 djing a unique and original sound has certainly emerged - fusing together 
 a quirky\, stripped back\, driving style of techno/trance. Her most recent
  track has just been released on 'Selected' Berlin. Laura’s love and com
 mitment to her craft and our scene is undeniable! #block-23d1ce845569b8cb7
