SUMMARY:BLACKEN FOREVER - Nationwide Festival (QLD)
DESCRIPTION:Blacken Forever is a nationwide celebration of music and solida
 rity\, bringing people together to support the movement to Save The Black 
 Wreath. From the biggest cities to the heart of the Dead Centre\, concerts
  will erupt simultaneously across the country\, featuring some of Australi
 a’s best heavy bands. One day\, one movement. One shot to Save The Black
  Wreath. Blacken Forever is a national show of strength\, unity and noise.
  Support the cause to save one of Australia's best heavy festival events. 
 QLD's only Blacken fundraiser event takes place at Gold Coast's Mo's Deser
 t Clubhouse on Saturday 12 September and will feature:\\ HELM (rare show) 
 SNAKE MOUNTAIN BLIND GIRLS HOLYSTONE COUCH WIZARD AWFUL NOISE BUNNY RACKET
  with LAGERSTEIN DJ SET Foodtruck onsite. Licensed bar in operation. Come 
 and help save an Australian heavy scene institution! LTD TIX GET IN EARLY.
  Proudly supported by Mo's Desert Clubhouse and Beats Cartel BLACKEN FOREV
 ER - QLD Fundraiser Saturday 12 September 2026 // 3pm doors $50 GA // ALL 
 AGES EVENT (Under 12s FREE) *Anyone under 18 must be accompanied by a pare
 nt or guardian and vacate the venue by 8pm Mo's Desert Clubhouse is the Go
 ld Coast's premier destination live music venue in the Burleigh Arts Quart
 e All GA punters will be requested to show ID
