BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:goldcoast-nbh0fr@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T160000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260913T210000
SUMMARY:MANEVA & FABIO BRAZZA + TÚLIO - Brazilian Day
DESCRIPTION:SUNDAY 13th of September | Miami Marketta | Gold Coast For the 
 first time as part of the Brazilian Day Experience\, one of Brazil's most 
 beloved bands\, Maneva\, brings their acclaimed live show to the Gold Coas
 t for a special night celebrating Brazilian music\, culture\, and communit
 y. With a career spanning over two decades\, MANEVA has become one of the 
 biggest names in Brazilian reggae\, captivating millions of fans through t
 heir uplifting melodies\, powerful lyrics\, and unforgettable live perform
 ances. Known for hits such as Lágrimas de Alegria\, Luz Que Me Traz Paz\,
  and O Destino Não Quis\, the band has built a devoted following througho
 ut Brazil and around the world\, delivering a unique blend of reggae\, roc
 k\, and Brazilian rhythms that continues to inspire audiences of all ages.
  Sharing the stage is renowned Brazilian rapper\, poet\, and songwriter F
 ÁBIO BRAZZA\, one of the most respected voices in contemporary Brazilian 
 hip-hop. Celebrated for his intelligent lyricism\, storytelling\, and powe
 rful social commentary\, Fábio Brazza's performances combine energy\, aut
 henticity\, and artistry in a way that resonates deeply with audiences. Op
 ening the celebration is Gold Coast-based Brazilian artist TÚLIO\, whose 
 music reflects the vibrant spirit of modern Brazil while representing the 
 strength and passion of Australia's Brazilian community. More than just a 
 concert\, Brazilian Day Experience is a celebration of everything that mak
 es Brazil unique. Enjoy authentic Brazilian food\, cultural experiences\, 
 art\, community connections\, and an atmosphere filled with the colours\, 
 flavours\, rhythms\, and energy that have made Brazilian culture famous wo
 rldwide. Whether you're Brazilian\, have Brazilian roots\, or simply love 
 great music and cultural experiences\, this is your opportunity to be part
  of an unforgettable event bringing the heart of Brazil to the Gold Coast.
  One day. Three incredible artists. One unforgettable Brazilian celebratio
 n. Presented by Tropical Lab and Folia's Entertainment.
LOCATION:Miami Marketta
URL:https://www.miamimarketta.com/ticketed-events/maneva
END:VEVENT
