BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:goldcoast-vldhrg@dothings
DTSTART;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260918T180000
DTEND;TZID=Australia/Brisbane:20260918T200000
SUMMARY:Synergy 360° Session
DESCRIPTION:SYNERGY 360° SESSION IS FINALLY HERE ☆ For one MEGA special\
 , and rare night on the Gold Coast. Our first ever boiler room inspired\, 
 360 session. Where the dancefloor surrounds the booth\, where we all becom
 e one\, connected by the rhythm of sound. ♡︎ This one is HUGE. Synergy
  welcomes Monika Ross\, Ross Weightman AKA ROSSCO\, Federico Gonzales\, to
  bless your ear drums. All coming together to provide groovy blends of ban
 ging electronic rhythms to take you on a journey. MONIKA ROSS Our headline
 r\, is a widely respected DJ and producer with raw\, authentic sounds that
  move effortlessly through minimal\, house\, breaks and garage. Fresh from
  her European tour\, we welcome her home. Her dynamic sets and signature s
 ound have led to appearances at some of the most iconic venues worldwide i
 ncluding SASH (Sydney)\, Fabric (London)\, Club der Visionaere (Berlin)\, 
 Watergate (Berlin)\, PAL (Hamburg)\, and Oxford Underground (Sydney)\, amo
 ng others. ROSS WEIGHTMAN (ROSSCO) Joining her is Ross Weightman AKA ROSSC
 O\, spins house music rooted in deep\, funky\, progressive grooves\, to ma
 ke you move. He has a big energy you will feel it when he does what he lov
 es! Beyond the booth\, you may also recognise him from Love Island Austral
 ia! FELIPE GONZALES Opening the journey is FELIPE GONZALEZ\, blending the 
 ultimate progressive\, organic house with melodic sounds sets shaped by hi
 s Argentinian roots. Felipe has the ability of reading the room and shapes
  his selections around the energy of the crowd. Get here early to watch th
 e magic unfold. This is going to be one for the books. We would love YOU t
 o experience it with us. Limited capacity\, don't sleep on it! ONE LOVE 
 ♡︎ Synergy familiiiliaaaa ꩜ Who are Synergy? heeEeelllloooo there :)
  we’re over the moon you found us. Synergy is an independent music event
 s organiser originating in Bristol\, England\, that crossed the pond to su
 nny Straya. A collective built around the power of music to bring people t
 ogether\, to bless your ear drums with incredible music. Our events create
  high energy spaces\, a dance floor where you feel free\, a place to let l
 oose\, get weird and be you :) A place you feel comfy. Like home. Surround
 ed by good vibez. With a focus on raw\, finely selected electronic music. 
 A little gritty-funky-underground flavour. No commercial ere. You share th
 e same values? come shake a leg. All aboard Synergy kruuuuu! FOLLOW THE JO
 URNEY - for more Synergy adventures ♡︎ @synergyevents._ Doors at 6pm (
 18+) with the venue's El Ranchero back deck and bar open from 6pm for pres
 how dinner and drinks. SYNERGY Mo's Desert Clubhouse / Burleigh Heads Frid
 ay 18 September 2026 Mo's is Burleigh Heads' most loved music venue\, lice
 nsed bars\, creative studios and cultural hub. The Warehouse & El Ranchero
  both boast epic bar menus\, cocktails and craft beers. Mo's is a fully li
 censed venue\, all guests are required to show ID on entry. Tickets will o
 nly be refunded through event cancellation or production of a medical cert
 ificate within 24hrs of show doors.
LOCATION:Mo's Desert Clubhouse
URL:https://tickets.oztix.com.au/outlet/event/3a48ae6b-dcf4-429a-8df1-50d4c
 2762369
